{
  "uid": "bank-errores",
  "title": "Bank USAC · Errores en tiempo real",
  "tags": [
    "bank-usac",
    "errores"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "description": "Lo que está fallando ahora mismo, de las métricas a la línea de log concreta.",
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "datasource",
          "uid": "grafana"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "bank-prometheus"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "expr": "max by (namespace, replicaset) (time() - kube_replicaset_created{namespace=~\"$namespace\"} < 180)",
        "iconColor": "light-blue",
        "name": "Despliegues",
        "titleFormat": "Despliegue: ReplicaSet nuevo {{replicaset}}",
        "textFormat": "namespace {{namespace}} · sólo un rollout crea un ReplicaSet; un escalado del HPA no",
        "step": "2m"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "datasource",
          "uid": "grafana"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "purple",
        "name": "Releases",
        "target": {
          "limit": 100,
          "matchAny": false,
          "tags": [
            "release"
          ],
          "type": "tags"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "prod",
          "value": "prod"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "bank-prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(environment)",
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Entorno",
        "name": "environment",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(environment)",
          "refId": "env"
        },
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "query"
      },
      {
        "current": {
          "text": "prod",
          "value": "prod"
        },
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "bank-prometheus"
        },
        "definition": "label_values(sli:namespace_environment:info{environment=\"$environment\"}, namespace)",
        "description": "El namespace del entorno elegido, leído de la regla sli:namespace_environment:info. En la nube es el mismo nombre (dev, prod); en kind el entorno local vive en bank-usac.",
        "hide": 2,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Namespace",
        "name": "namespace",
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(sli:namespace_environment:info{environment=\"$environment\"}, namespace)",
          "refId": "namespace"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "type": "query"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 27,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "5xx del Gateway (por segundo)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bank-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.1
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 3
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "bank-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_count{service_name=\"gateway\", environment=\"$environment\", http_response_status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Cero eventos es una respuesta, no un hueco: la serie sólo existe tras el primer error, así que sin `or vector(0)` un sistema sano mostraba «No data» (T-60)."
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Entregas a la cola muerta (por segundo)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bank-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.001
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 4
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "bank-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(messaging_client_consumed_messages_total{environment=\"$environment\", bank_delivery_outcome=\"dead_letter\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Cero eventos es una respuesta, no un hueco: la serie sólo existe tras el primer error, así que sin `or vector(0)` un sistema sano mostraba «No data» (T-60)."
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Mensajes ilegibles en auditoría (por segundo)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bank-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.001
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 4
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "bank-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(bank_audit_events_total{environment=\"$environment\", processing=\"invalid\"}[5m])) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "description": "Cero eventos es una respuesta, no un hueco: la serie sólo existe tras el primer error, así que sin `or vector(0)` un sistema sano mostraba «No data» (T-60)."
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Anomalías de cuenta detectadas (última hora)",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bank-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "bank-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(sli:account_anomalies:increase1h{environment=\"$environment\"}) or vector(0)",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Entregas que no terminaron en ack, por cola",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bank-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "bank-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (messaging_destination_name, bank_delivery_outcome) (rate(messaging_client_consumed_messages_total{environment=\"$environment\", bank_delivery_outcome!=\"ack\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{messaging_destination_name}} · {{bank_delivery_outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "`retry` es normal y esperado; `dead_letter` e `invalid` no. Ver el runbook dead-letter.md."
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Transferencias que terminaron en FAILED, por motivo",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "bank-prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "showPoints": "never"
          },
          "unit": "reqps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "bank-prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (rate(bank_transfer_finished_total{environment=\"$environment\", result=\"failed\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "description": "`result` va en minúsculas: el código lo emite con `step.to.toLowerCase()` (`otel-transfer.telemetry.ts`). Con `FAILED` el panel salía vacío siempre."
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Todos los errores, de todos los servicios",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "bank-loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "bank-loki"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=~\".+\", deployment_environment=\"$environment\"} | level=\"error\"",
          "refId": "A",
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Cada línea lleva correlationId y traceId: el botón «Ver la traza» salta a Tempo, y «Ver el flujo completo» muestra el mismo correlationId en todos los servicios."
    }
  ]
}
